# defkeymap.map - the console's compiled-in keymap (US)
#
# What dumpkeys prints for the keymap the kernel starts with;
# 'loadkeys -d' loads it.  Written by host/test-keymap.sh
# (KBDTEST_UPDATE=1), which also checks it is current.
#
# Copyright (C) 2026 The LikeOS Project
